# OPTIONAL. The contact form already works without this: it posts to
# FormSubmit using the address in lib/content.js, and the first message
# sends you a one-time confirmation email you need to click.
#
# If you'd rather route mail through Formspree, create a form at
# https://formspree.io and paste the ID from your endpoint
# (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx -> the part after /f/) below.
# When set, it takes priority over FormSubmit.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
